// A US citizen who moved from San Francisco to Berlin on 2025-07-01. Calendar year
// 2025. Reports are in dollars; the German pay, rent and savings are in euros, and
// a trip to London is in pounds.
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2025/07.ax holds July 2025 only.

base USD

use std
use us/401k
use us/ca
use us/abroad
use de

/// Dana, 37, single. San Francisco until the end of June, Berlin from July 1.
///
/// Residences may overlap. Until June 30, Dana lives in San Francisco (and so under
/// California and the United States). From July 1, Dana lives in Germany and, as a
/// citizen abroad, still under the United States: the two residences cover the
/// same days, and each system governs on the days its residence does. A part-year
/// resident of California owes California for the part of the year, and the
/// exclusion of the German pay is a law of `us/abroad`, in force from July.
entity me : person
  born   1987-09-14
  filing single
  lives  us/ca/san-francisco until 2025-06-30
  lives  us/abroad from 2025-07-01
  lives  de from 2025-07-01
